
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model library, please cite it as below."
title: "1729 SWMM5 Models 2030: A Library of EPA SWMM5 Test and Reference Models"
abstract: >-
  A curated library of EPA SWMM5 input (.inp) models covering hydrology,
  hydraulics, LID controls, force mains, pumps, weirs, orifices and
  dynamic-wave routing, together with XPSWMM conversions and training
  examples. Each model carries an auto-generated Markdown summary.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Dickinson
    given-names: Robert E.
license: Unlicense
repository-code: "https://github.com/SWMMBobSWMM6/1729-SWMM5-Models-2030"
keywords:
  - SWMM5
  - EPA SWMM
  - stormwater
  - hydrology
  - hydraulics
  - dynamic wave routing
  - LID
  - XPSWMM
